<h1>Bone Carving</h1>
<p><strong>Vintage Story: 1.22.x.</strong></p>
<p>the fox can still make a bone handle. the patch-number label was the only carving in this update.</p>
<p>Hold one bone in the offhand and a vanilla knife in the main hand, then hold right-click for two seconds to carve an inert Bone Handle. Both client and server load this small proof of concept.</p>
<p>Minimum game version: 1.22.0. Load/save/reload smoke passed on 1.22.7. Feature-specific gameplay remains outside that smoke.</p>
<p><em>mod was made with AI assistance. Pls no hate.</em></p>
